x520 call close x519 
x521 call open x520 2
x522 write x521 2
x523 text "This is everything a model is told before it writes or edits A0. The sections below say the same thing in full."
x524 puts x522 x523
x525 call close x524 
x526 call open x525 10
x527 write x526 4
x528 write x527 2
x529 text "code wrap"
x530 puts x528 x529
x531 call open x530 4
