x533 text "A0: `fn NAME T... -> T`, lines `ID OP ARG...`, `ret ARG`, `end`. Types u32 bool, arrays u32x4, records (u32,bool). Params p0 p1... Args: earlier ID, pN, u32 literal, true, false. Ops exact mod 2^32.\n"
x534 puts x532 x533
x535 write x534 2
x536 text "add sub mul and or xor (bool too) shl shr (count&31) div (b=0: 4294967295) rem (b=0: a) eq ne lt le gt ge (unsigned, -> bool) select c x y\n"
