x543 puts x541 x542
x544 write x543 2
x545 text "EDIT: reply bare edit lines, e.g. `c add a b` (replaces c or inserts before ret; `c add a b @ x` inserts after x), `-c`, `ret c`, `fn f ...` (adds/replaces a function), `-fn f`.\n"
x546 puts x544 x545
x547 call close x546 
x548 call close x547 
