x579 call close x578 
x580 write x579 2
x581 text "fn clamp u32 u32 u32 -> u32\nlo lt p0 p1\nhi lt p2 p0\na select lo p1 p0\nr select hi p2 a\nret r\nend"
x582 puts x580 x581
x583 call close x582 
x584 call close x583 
x585 call close x584 
x586 call open x585 13
x587 write x586 4
x588 write x587 1
x589 text "types"
