x643 call open x642 11
x644 write x643 2
x645 text "Modules"
x646 puts x644 x645
x647 call close x646 
x648 call open x647 2
x649 write x648 2
x650 text "A file starts with zero or more `use \"path.a0\"` lines, relative to the file. The linker loads every used file once, orders them by dependency, and checks the result as one program with one namespace. Cycles and duplicate function names are rejected, and diagnostics name the file and line."
x651 puts x649 x650
x652 call close x651 
x653 call open x652 10
x654 write x653 4
x655 write x654 2
x656 text "code"
x657 puts x655 x656
